$DIR/main.p:7:7: a function literal that captures variables cannot be started with a task statement: wg lives in the starting frame, which may be gone before the task runs (spec section 12.12); wg has type sync.WaitGroup, which must not be copied, so start the literal with a sync.Scope, which waits for it and lets it use wg: var s sync.Scope; s.Task(func() {...})
